Of course, it contains an annoying bug: the numbers are printed _before_
the name. The correct code is:

    \IfNoValueTF{#1}
      {\TShead@format{#2}{#1}{#3}}
      {\TShead@format{#2}{\csname the#1\endcsname}{#3}}

